      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    S = 85\n    K = 90\n    r = 0.05\n    T = 5\n    c = 10\n    p = 15\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    # Put-call parity with continuous dividend yield:\n    # c - p = S * exp(-qT) - K * exp(-rT)\n    import math\n\n    discounted_strike = K * math.exp(-r * T)\n    implied_forward_stock = c - p + discounted_strike\n    q = -math.log(implied_forward_stock / S) / T\n\n    answer = round(q * 100, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
